  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Orchestrate Human Work with Microsoft 365 To Do",
    "splashDescription": "Microsoft 365 To Do is a popular way to manage lists of items for knowledge workers to complete. This outbound Connector enables you to manage To Do items from Camunda-based processes. It uses a REST API to communicate with To Do and supports CRUD operations on task lists, tasks, and check list items.",
